---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-[#e6e6e0] dark:border-[#262930] py-8 mt-16 text-xs text-txt-muted-light dark:text-txt-muted-dark transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-center sm:text-left">
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <p class="font-medium text-[#22252a] dark:text-[#e2e4e9]">
        Arthur C. Vaelen
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed max-w-md">
        Analitikus kutatások, AuDHD rendszerszemlélet és a csendes szolgálat tapasztalatai.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-[11px]">
      <a
        href="/rss.xml"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-accent dark:hover:text-accent-dark transition-colors"
      >
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
          <path d="M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <path d="M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="5" cy="19" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
        </svg>
        <span>RSS Feed</span>
      </a>

      <span>&copy; {currentYear} Arthur C. Vaelen</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
